  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "トバリシティの　はずれにある\nギンガだんの　あやしい\nそうこに　はいるための　カギ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "장막시티 변두리에 있는\n갤럭시단의 수상한 창고에\n들어가기 위한 열쇠다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用於進入銀河隊在\n帷幕市市郊的\n可疑倉庫的鑰匙。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La clé de l’entrepôt de la Team Galaxie situé à\nla périphérie de Voilaroc.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Schlüssel zur Lagerhalle von Team Galaktik am\nRande von Schleiede.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Llave del siniestro almacén del Equipo Galaxia que\nestá ubicado en las afueras de Ciudad Rocavelo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chiave del misterioso deposito del Team Galassia\nsituato ai confini di Rupepoli.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The key to Team Galactic’s sinister warehouse\nlocated at the edge of Veilstone City.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
